WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.558
A market move can affect every position differently. Buffer makes those differences

00:00:05.558 --> 00:00:05.992
visible.

00:00:06.892 --> 00:00:12.169
Start with an editable sample, or read a public account without connecting

00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:17.446
a wallet. Explore seventy-six sample markets, change the price move, and follow

00:00:17.446 --> 00:00:18.325
each contribution.

00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:26.001
Velocity and Pacifica support price scenarios. Jupiter adds clearly labeled position inventory.

00:00:26.001 --> 00:00:28.825
Unsupported exposure keeps its explanation.

00:00:29.725 --> 00:00:35.381
Open the method. Inspect the source. Save a dated report. The result

00:00:35.381 --> 00:00:41.036
is a focused price effect, with fees, funding, collateral changes, and liquidation

00:00:41.036 --> 00:00:42.450
outside the calculation.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:48.035
On mobile or desktop, Buffer gives you room to understand the numbers

00:00:48.035 --> 00:00:51.158
before you act. Buffer. A little more perspective.
